# Sky whale body plan — EDIT ME to redesign the whale; the game and the
# tests load this file. Preview it without booting the game:
#
#   godot --headless --path . --script tools/ship_preview.gd -- ships/whale.ship
#
# Proportions follow the owner's survey (2026-08-20): thin parts ~10
# source blocks (~1 of our authored cells per player-height... ours run
# 2 rows at the tail strand), thickest ~20-30 (~3-4 rows here), long
# sperm-whale profile — blunt head to the RIGHT, tapering tail to a
# fluke LEFT. The two empty cells inside the body are the STOMACH
# cavity (source whales carry swallowed loot there — the loot itself
# waits for items to exist; the compartment is real today: mine in and
# you break through into a hollow).
#
#   W  blubber (buoyant flesh — keep it the majority or the whale falls)
#   M  meat (dense core)
#
# The whale floats because it is mostly blubber — mining the blubber
# off a carcass literally sinks it. Keep it one connected piece.

origin 12 1

.W.....WWWWWWWWWWWWWWWW...
.WWWWWWWWWMMMMM..MMMMWWWW.
.WWWWWWWWMMMMMMMMMMMMWWWW.
.W.....WWWWWWWWWWWWWWWW...
